    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>WarningAboutUnsentEmailsLabel</name>
      <id>477</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Scheduled job &lt;b>Mail sync&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> is disabled. &lt;link EnableReceivingAndSendingEmails>Click here to enable&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>کار زمان‌بندی‌شده &lt;b>همگام‌سازی ایمیل&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> غیرفعال است. &lt;link EnableReceivingAndSendingEmails>برای فعال‌سازی اینجا کلیک کنید&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Регламентное задание &lt;b>Получение&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>и&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>отправка&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>писем&lt;/> отключено, доставка писем не выполняется. &lt;link EnableReceivingAndSendingEmails>Включить&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Zamanlanmış görev &lt;b> E-posta&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>alımı&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>ve&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>gönderimi&lt;/> devre dışı, iletiler ulaştırılamıyor. &lt;link EnableReceivingAndSendingEmails>Etkinleştir&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Nhiệm vụ thường xuyên &lt;b>Nhận&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>và&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>gửi&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>thư&lt;/> bị vô hiệu hóa, gửi thư không được thực hiện. &lt;link EnableReceivingAndSendingEmails>Bật&lt;/></value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Scheduled job &lt;b>Mail sync&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> is disabled. &lt;link EnableReceivingAndSendingEmails>Click here to enable&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Scheduled job &lt;b>Mail sync&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/> is disabled. &lt;link EnableReceivingAndSendingEmails>Click here to enable&lt;/>.</value>
      </title>
